# No environment variables are required to run this pipeline today.
# src/categorize.py is a zero-cost, local rule-based classifier -- it makes
# no external API calls. This file is provided in case the categorizer is
# ever swapped for an LLM-based one (see docs/methodology.md §4 for why
# that wasn't necessary here).
#
# If you do add an LLM provider later, follow this pattern (never commit
# a real key -- this file should only ever contain empty placeholders):
#
# ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=
# OPENAI_API_KEY=
